---
description: Multi-language (i18n) rules for Android resources
globs: "**/res/**/*,**/*Screen*.kt,**/*Composable*.kt"
alwaysApply: false
---

# i18n

- User-facing text → `strings.xml` (and locale variants). Never hardcode in Compose/Kotlin.
- Default English: `values/strings.xml`
- Vietnamese: `values-vi/strings.xml` (keep keys identical)
- Naming: `<feature>_<element>` or `general_*` for shared copy
- When adding a key, add **all** supported locales in the same change
- Prefer `stringResource(R.string.*)` in Compose
